---
const symptoms = ['Ruidos extraños', 'Pérdida de potencia', 'Vibraciones', 'Luces en el tablero'];
---

<section id="inicio" class="hero">
  <div class="hero-bg" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="hero-gradient"></div>
    <div class="hero-grid"></div>
    <div class="hero-glow hero-glow-1"></div>
    <div class="hero-glow hero-glow-2"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="container hero-content">
    <div class="hero-text">
      <div class="hero-badge">
        <span class="badge-dot"></span>
        Especialistas en Ford · +20 años de experiencia
      </div>

      <h1 class="hero-title">
        ¿Su vehículo presenta una <span class="highlight">falla</span>?
      </h1>

      <p class="hero-lead">
        No espere a que el problema empeore. Ignorar una señal puede convertir una reparación sencilla en un gasto mayor.
      </p>

      <ul class="symptoms" aria-label="Señales de falla">
        {symptoms.map((s) => (
          <li>
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M12 9v4m0 4h.01M10.29 3.86L1.82 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.42 0z"/>
            </svg>
            {s}
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>

      <p class="hero-desc">
        Con más de 20 años de experiencia y especialización en vehículos Ford, estamos listos para darle un diagnóstico honesto y una solución real. Utilizamos repuestos originales y las mejores prácticas para que su vehículo vuelva a funcionar con seguridad.
      </p>

      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#contacto" class="btn btn-primary">
          Agendar diagnóstico
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a href="#servicios" class="btn btn-outline">Conocer servicios</a>
      </div>

      <p class="hero-tagline">Su tranquilidad comienza con una revisión a tiempo.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-visual" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="visual-card">
        <div class="visual-header">
          <span class="visual-status">Diagnóstico activo</span>
          <span class="visual-pulse"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="visual-body">
          <svg class="car-icon" viewBox="0 0 200 80" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <path d="M30 50h140M20 50l15-25h30l10 15h50l10-15h25l15 25" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            <circle cx="55" cy="50" r="12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"/>
            <circle cx="145" cy="50" r="12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"/>
            <path d="M65 25h70" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.5"/>
          </svg>
          <div class="scan-line"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="visual-stats">
          <div class="stat">
            <span class="stat-value">20+</span>
            <span class="stat-label">Años</span>
          </div>
          <div class="stat">
            <span class="stat-value">100%</span>
            <span class="stat-label">Honestidad</span>
          </div>
          <div class="stat">
            <span class="stat-value">Ford</span>
            <span class="stat-label">Especialistas</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: calc(var(--header-height) + 3rem) 0 4rem;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hero-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .hero-gradient {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 70% 20%, rgba(0, 52, 120, 0.25) 0%, transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 50% at 20% 80%, rgba(0, 52, 120, 0.08) 0%, transparent 55%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg-primary) 0%, var(--bg-secondary) 100%);
  }

  .hero-grid {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(0, 52, 120, 0.04) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0, 52, 120, 0.04) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 60px 60px;
    mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 70% at 50% 50%, black 20%, transparent 80%);
  }

  .hero-glow {
    position: absolute;
    border-radius: 50%;
    filter: blur(80px);
  }

  .hero-glow-1 {
    width: 400px;
    height: 400px;
    top: -100px;
    right: -100px;
    background: rgba(0, 52, 120, 0.1);
  }

  .hero-glow-2 {
    width: 300px;
    height: 300px;
    bottom: 0;
    left: -50px;
    background: rgba(0, 52, 120, 0.2);
  }

  .hero-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .hero-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.4rem 1rem 0.4rem 0.75rem;
    background: rgba(0, 52, 120, 0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 52, 120, 0.15);
    border-radius: 100px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .badge-dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    background: var(--accent);
    border-radius: 50%;
    animation: pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @keyframes pulse {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
    50% { opacity: 0.5; transform: scale(0.85); }
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 3.75rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .highlight {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent) 0%, var(--accent-bright) 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  .hero-lead {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 540px;
  }

  .symptoms {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0.5rem 1.5rem;
  }

  .symptoms li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .symptoms svg {
    color: var(--accent);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .hero-desc {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    max-width: 520px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .hero-tagline {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .hero-visual {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .visual-card {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 420px;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
  }

  .visual-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
  }

  .visual-status {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent-light);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .visual-pulse {
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    background: var(--accent-bright);
    border-radius: 50%;
    animation: pulse 1.5s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .visual-body {
    position: relative;
    padding: 3rem 2rem;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0, 52, 120, 0.08) 0%, transparent 100%);
  }

  .car-icon {
    width: 200px;
    height: 80px;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .scan-line {
    position: absolute;
    left: 10%;
    right: 10%;
    height: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--accent), transparent);
    animation: scan 3s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @keyframes scan {
    0%, 100% { top: 20%; opacity: 0; }
    10% { opacity: 1; }
    50% { top: 80%; opacity: 1; }
    60% { opacity: 0; }
  }

  .visual-stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .stat {
    padding: 1.25rem 1rem;
    text-align: center;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .stat:last-child {
    border-right: none;
  }

  .stat-value {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
  }

  .stat-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .hero-content {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
    }

    .hero-visual {
      order: -1;
    }

    .visual-card {
      max-width: 100%;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .symptoms {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
